<title>AUSTRALIA: Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last month.</title>
<headline>Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last month.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the month to May 16.</p>
<p>Top 10 gains in month   Price     percent</p>
<p>Rank Name		   May 16    change</p>
<p>1   Futuris		  2.12	17.78</p>
<p>2   Pasminco		 2.66	16.16</p>
<p>3   RGC			5.25	15.89</p>
<p>4   CSL			7.40	15.63</p>
<p>5   Wesfarmers	    11.41.5    14.15</p>
<p>6   Comalco		  7.02	13.54</p>
<p>7   Woodside Pet	  11.20	13.48</p>
<p>8   Howard Smith	  11.90	13.33</p>
<p>9   Santos		   5.57	13.21</p>
<p>10  North		    4.65	12.62</p>
<p>Top 10 falls in month   Price     percent</p>
<p>Rank Name		   May 16    change</p>
<p>1   Newcrest Mining	3.40     -16.67</p>
<p>2   Burns Philp	    1.85     -11.90</p>
<p>3   Village prefs	  3.14	-9.77</p>
<p>4   Crown		    2.04	-9.33</p>
<p>5   Email		    4.00	-6.76</p>
<p>6   Davids		   1.27	-6.62</p>
<p>7   Schroder Prop	  2.13	-6.17</p>
<p>8   Village Roadshow     4.35	-5.43</p>
<p>9   Westfield America    1.04	-4.59</p>
<p>10  Sons of Gwalia	 5.75	-3.85</p>
<p>--Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
